        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Fly Tying Beads (Including Tungsten)",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Beads set weight and head profile. Tungsten sinks faster in a smaller size; brass is moderate; glass stays light. Slotted beads fit jig hooks and straight shanks. Heads stay out of this collection. Not a sale page.</p><h3>Bead size to hook size</h3><ul><li>~1.5–2.0 mm (1/16\") — midges and light nymphs</li><li>~2.4–2.8 mm — standard nymphs</li><li>~3.3–3.8 mm (1/8\") — larger nymphs and small streamers</li><li>~5.5 mm — Spawn football beads</li><li>~8–9 mm — Spawn Fathom beads for heavy steelhead builds</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
